tton" role="option" data-choice="compact" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Compact</button></span></span></label><fieldset><legend>Workspace guidance</legend><label class="ov-check"><input type="checkbox" name="hints" checked><span>Show helpful hints</span></label><label class="ov-check"><input type="checkbox" name="labels" checked><span>Show full labels</span></label></fieldset><div class="ov-note" data-setting-sample>Project brief<br>Review notes</div><p class="ov-muted" data-setting-hint>Compact rows fit more projects. Changes stay in this example.</p></div></div><footer class="ov-foot"><button type="button" data-action="cancel">Cancel</button><button type="button" data-action="apply" class="ov-primary">Apply</button></footer></section></div>\n</div>';const J=`@font-face{font-family:'Instrument Sans';src:url('./instrument-sans-variable.woff2') format('woff2');font-weight:400 700;font-display:swap}
